    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 70 Drisin is a beautifully presented three bedroom semi detached home that has been exceptionally well cared for and upgraded by its current owner. Presented in true turn-key condition, west facing rear garden, the property offers a warm and comfortable home where no expense has been spared, allowing the next owner to simply move in and enjoy.\n\nBuilt in 2005 by Sawgrass Properties, the home is ideally positioned within this well managed development and benefits from a low maintenance west facing rear garden along with two off-street parking spaces to the front. There is also additional communal parking located directly across from the house.\n\nThe accommodation is bright, welcoming and very well laid out, creating a practical and cosy three bedroom family home. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a comfortable living room featuring a bay window that fills the space with natural light. To the rear, the open plan kitchen and dining area overlooks and opens directly onto the large rear garden, making it a lovely space for everyday living as well as entertaining. Custom built understairs storage and a upgraded guest WC complete the ground floor. \n\nUpstairs there are three well proportioned bedrooms, including upgraded main bedroom and ensuite in the master.\nDrisin is located just off the Upper Ballymoneen Road and is well served by a range of local amenities including schools, shops, recreational and sporting facilities, making it a convenient and established place to live. A bright and airy attic space enhanced by a Velux roof window.\n\nA truly turn-key home that must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\nGarden: Two off street parking spaces are located to the front of the property along with a EV charge point, mature hedging in a raised block built and additional communal parking nearby. The west facing rear garden also features a paved cobble lock patio area and astro turf grass, ideal for outdoor dining and relaxing, matures trees and the boundaries defined by block built walls, concrete panels & timber fencing. Steeltech shed provides further storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nTiled floor, coving, recess lighting, custom built under stairs storage, carpet on stairs.\n\nLiving Room: - \nLaminate floor, coving, recess lighting, plantation shutters, front aspect window.\n\nKitchen Dining Room: - \nTiled floor, recess lighting, wall and floor kitchen units, ample storage, tiled splashback, plumbed for dishwasher & washing machine, access to rear garden, rear aspect window.\n\nWC: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin with vanity unit, mirror.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nSemi solid timber floor, sliderobe & wardrobe, plantation shutters, front aspect window.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nTiled floor & shower, wc, wash hand basin with vanity, mirror, Mira electric shower.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nSemi solid timber floor, sliderobe, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nSemi solid timber floor, plantation shutters, front aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin with vanity, mirror with light, heated towel rail, Mira electric shower, walk in shower with wet floor, rain shower head, custom built in shelving, towel rail, rear aspect window.\n\nHot Press: - \nShelved, hot water tank.\n\n"
      },
      {
